Per our call - A note on filer support volumes. Requests for access code re=
sets rise sharply around the annual amendment deadline and the queue length=
ens accordingly. If a registrant contacts you directly about codes, route t=
hem to filer support rather than raising a ticket on their behalf; the tick=
et has to come from the filer. Correspondence should be addressed to this o=
ffice rather than to individual staff.